# What gets uploaded to Cloud Build.

# Secrets must never reach the build context. The Dockerfile copies backend/
# wholesale, so an .env in there would be baked into a public image. Runtime
# config comes from --set-env-vars and Secret Manager instead.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Rebuilt inside the image by pip and npm ci.
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/dist/
**/build/

.git/
.gitignore
tests/
docs/
README.md
**/logs/
*.log
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
